		},
		{
			"id":"9269352265326a97",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## Phimosis\n- ### hygiene of rings\n\t- Soap for washing\n\t- Vinegar can be a bonus\n\t- Store in clean & dry place to avoid dust and lint\n- ### Hygiene of penis\n\t- Don't over wash - it can do harm. \n- ### coconut oil\n\t- Avoid until can clean properly (or like external only)\n\t- Or at the very least do absolutely minimum to just have some lubrication (if needed)\n\t- Risk of infection/buildup is increased if can't clean. \n- ### Duration\n\t- 15 minutes for the first time\n\t- 30-60mins for long-term\n\t- 2-3 times a day. \n- ### Application\n\t- Warm water to soften skin\n\t- Wear until it falls out. \n\t- DON'T RUSH, because if skin healing won't catchup - it'll scar and will shrink instead. \n\t- Stretchmarks means skin can't stretch fast (genetically), so be super conservative and don't rush.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":280,
			"y":-270,
			"width":520,
			"height":560
		}
	],
